1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,605
Hi, Susan.

2
00:00:00,985 --> 00:00:02,625
This is Steve from the Accounting Department.

3
00:00:03,365 --> 00:00:11,185
I heard from the receptionist that you are very busy today because of job interviews, but I have to bring some urgent, outstanding financial matters to your attention.

4
00:00:12,205 --> 00:00:16,725
Would it be possible for us to get together in my office, say, tomorrow morning at ten?

5
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:26,485
The particular items I would like to discuss with you relate to claims for travel expenses made by members of the Personnel Department after the conference last September.

6
00:00:27,425 --> 00:00:33,850
There are no serious problems with these claims, but in many cases the claims forms haven't been completed satisfactorily.

7
00:00:34,645 --> 00:00:36,345
I'm sure we can clear this up quickly.

8
00:00:36,785 --> 00:00:38,685
Let me know if you can't make it tomorrow.
